@node Filter toggle state
@section Filter toggle state

@vindex elfeed-extras-toggle-read-entries
The variable @code{elfeed-extras-toggle-read-entries} tracks the current state of the read/unread filter toggle. When non-nil (the default)@comma{} the next invocation of the command @code{elfeed-extras-toggle-read-entries} (@ref{Filtering, , Filtering}) will show all entries; when nil@comma{} it will restrict the view to unread entries only.

@vindex elfeed-extras-toggle-wiki-entries
The variable @code{elfeed-extras-toggle-wiki-entries} tracks the current state of the wiki filter toggle. When non-nil (the default)@comma{} the next invocation of the command @code{elfeed-extras-toggle-wiki-entries} (@ref{Filtering, , Filtering}) will show only unread wiki entries; when nil@comma{} it will show all unread entries except wiki entries.

